Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And the most valuable\Ntrap of this chapter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You no longer need to apply\Nfor Government accommodation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.76,0:00:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,or furnish a No Accommodation Certificate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.10,0:00:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That condition was dispensed\Nwith by the Department
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.65,0:00:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,of Expenditure order of\Nthird May, twenty nineteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.39,0:00:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Annexure Three is still\Nrequired for the specific
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.39,0:00:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,cases listed in Paragraph 7.3.
